     "@id": "http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/CFSN0023/"
    },
    {
     "@id": "https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/926c1b80-6c11-40eb-ae7f-f5bcfdc43fac"
    }
   ],
   "skos:editorialNote": [
    {
     "@value": "GCMD closeMatch(EARTH SCIENCE > ATMOSPHERE > ATMOSPHERIC TEMPERATURE > UPPER AIR TEMPERATURE): OSCAR는 3D 장. GCMD는 지상 기온(SURFACE TEMPERATURE)을 따로 둔다",
     "@language": "ko"
    }
   ],
   "nmsc:inclusionBasis": [
    {
     "@value": "gk2a-product"
    }
   ],
   "skos:scopeNote": [
    {
     "@value": "GK 탑재체의 OSCAR 측정 평가표에는 없지만 GK-2A 확실 산출물이 값을 내는 변수라서 추가했다. 산출물 근거로 들어온 변수이므로 nmsc:ObservingCapability 가 없다. 어느 산출물인지는 nmsc:estimatesVariable 의 역방향으로 찾는다. OSCAR 변수 237개 전체를 복제하지 않는다.",
     "@language": "ko"
    },
    {
     "@value": "Not in the OSCAR measurement evaluation table of the GK payloads, but added because a confirmed GK-2A product produces values for it. Because the variable was added on product evidence, it has no nmsc:ObservingCapability. Which product it comes from is found through the inverse of nmsc:estimatesVariable. The full set of 237 OSCAR variables is not copied.",
     "@language": "en"
    }
   ]
  },
