    },
    {
     "@value": "GCMD narrowMatch(EARTH SCIENCE > LAND SURFACE > SURFACE RADIATIVE PROPERTIES > EMISSIVITY): GCMD 키워드는 육지면 한정",
     "@language": "ko"
