     "@language": "ko"
    },
    {
     "@value": "Physical-target group of products whose values describe the thermodynamic state of the air — vertical profiles of temperature and humidity, precipitable water and atmospheric stability.",
     "@language": "en"
    }
   ],
   "skos:editorialNote": [
    {
     "@value": "정의는 검토 전 초안이다(확신도 보통)",
